    (method method:schedule)
    (date "2026-03-01")))

; A room whose ring crosses itself, carrying one too. The two defects are
; different mistakes with different fixes and the plan treats them the same
; way, which is what stops which of them a model happens to hold deciding how
; much of the storey comes back.
(node site:R-03
  (label "Meeting Room C")
  (kind Space)
  (type MeetingRoom)
  (geometry area)
